-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. deepagents  https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

deepagents is an open-source Python project published under the MIT License.
The crate crates/deepagents-rs describes itself in its manifest as a Rust port
of deepagents. Some model-facing text in this repository is identical to, or
adapted from, deepagents, and many comments describe the code as following it.
docs/oss-review.md lists the places found.

The copyright line of deepagents' LICENSE file changed on 2026-02-04, so both
published versions are reproduced below, each exactly as published:

  - the file on the main branch of deepagents (commit
    c5313d7005534c8f8514004890c6f6d5174c6e2f, dated 2026-10-16), and
  - the file at release 0.3.8 (commit
    7db4736d717ab5412daa3c594b57b1f4e3bb3eca), the release named in comments in
    this repository.

