2. LangChain  https://github.com/langchain-ai/langchain
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The TODO_SYSTEM_PROMPT text in
crates/deepagents-rs/src/builtin/todos.rs follows the WRITE_TODOS_SYSTEM_PROMPT
text of LangChain's TodoListMiddleware
(libs/langchain_v1/langchain/agents/middleware/todo.py in that repository).
That text is the same in the LangChain releases 1.0.0, 1.1.0, 1.2.0, 1.2.3 and
1.2.4, which were compared; the word-for-word comparison was made at 1.2.4.
The opening of the write_todos tool description in the same Rust file also
uses words similar to LangChain's WRITE_TODOS_TOOL_DESCRIPTION. LangChain is
published under the MIT License. Its LICENSE file is identical to the first
copy reproduced below (checked at release 1.2.4 and on its master branch).

